Subject: [PATCH 01/21] PCI: add busn_res into struct pci_bus.
Date: Mon,  7 May 2012 13:29:46 -0700
Message-Id: <1336422606-4244-2-git-send-email-yinghai@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.7
